{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hcrql4fq","slide":2,"text":"Enterprise data lakes can store large volumes of data, but the context around those datasets is scattered.","textPreview":"Enterprise data lakes can store large volumes of data, but the context around those datasets is scattered.","textChars":106,"textLines":1,"bbox":[90,162,980,70]}
