{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/va98juxk","slide":2,"text":"Fragmented metadata","textPreview":"Fragmented metadata","textChars":19,"textLines":1,"bbox":[108,286,274,34]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wfypgvyl","slide":2,"text":"Schemas, storage paths, topics, and pipeline context are hard to inspect in one place.","textPreview":"Schemas, storage paths, topics, and pipeline context are hard to inspect in one place.","textChars":86,"textLines":1,"bbox":[108,326,274,118]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/xg7q90f6","slide":2,"bbox":[455,270,330,190]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5oju9ojq","slide":2,"text":"Relationship complexity","textPreview":"Relationship complexity","textChars":23,"textLines":1,"bbox":[473,286,294,34]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4nad0j25","slide":2,"text":"Traditional tables are awkward for dynamic relationships between datasets, processes, runs, and columns.","textPreview":"Traditional tables are awkward for dynamic relationships between datasets, processes, runs, and columns.","textChars":104,"textLines":1,"bbox":[473,326,294,118]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/jm1c7e1k","slide":2,"bbox":[840,270,330,190]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/il8vy9kf","slide":2,"text":"Lineage blindspot","textPreview":"Lineage blindspot","textChars":17,"textLines":1,"bbox":[858,286,294,34]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/tcjudoj2","slide":2,"text":"Without run-level evidence, it is difficult to prove when a schema changed and which run caused it.","textPreview":"Without run-level evidence, it is difficult to prove when a schema changed and which run caused it.","textChars":99,"textLines":1,"bbox":[858,326,294,118]}
